{"id":"suite","lemma":"suite","pos":"noun","rank":270,"glosses":["rest, continuation (tout de suite = right away)","suite"],"ipa":"/sɥit/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/03/Fr-suite.ogg/Fr-suite.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"suites"},"formAudio":{"suites":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/dd/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-suites.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Vous connaissez la suite.","en":"You know the rest.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to know","l":"connaître"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Fais-le tout de suite.","en":"Do it right now.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1093511","words":[{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"all"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Dois-je partir de suite ?","en":"Do I need to go right away?","words":[{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to go away"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Tu connais la suite de l'histoire.","en":"You know the rest of the story.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to know","l":"connaître"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"story"}]},{"text":"Elle est morte des suites d'un choc.","en":"She died of shock.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"dead","l":"mort"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"hit, strike"}]}]}